OL,3,GNEWSANowak family say police failed
OL,4,Athem multiple times
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of murdered student Henry
OL,7,FNowak have said police gave changing
OL,8,Faccounts of the events surrounding his
OL,9,Fdeath and did not initially disclose
OL,10,Fthey had handcuffed him as he lay
OL,11,Fdying.
OL,13,FThey said police initially portrayed
OL,14,Fhim as the aggressor in the fatal
OL,15,Faltercation with killer Vickrum Digwa
OL,16,Fin Southampton on 3 December 2025.
OL,18,FThe 18-year-old's stepmother Katie
OL,19,FNowak said Hampshire Police had failed
OL,20,Fthem "multiple times".
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
